# <PROJECT> — Local Session State (gitignored)

Rename to `CLAUDE.local.md` and use for per-machine notes, session-to-session
state, and anything that doesn't belong in the committed AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md.

## Deployment / scheduling

- Host: (e.g. always-on Mac Studio)
- launchd label: `com.<you>.<project>` — plist + wrapper under `launchd/`
- Log dir: `~/.claude/logs/<project>/`
- Discord notify script: `~/.claude/scripts/discord-notify.sh` (failure-only)

## Secrets (locations only — never values here)

Config names the env var; the value lives out of band:

- `TOOLNAME_TOKEN` — API token; sourced from `~/.claude/secrets/<project>.env`
  (chmod 600) or 1Password via `op run` at wrapper start.

## Session Log

Record ongoing work here between sessions; trim to the last ~10 entries.
